<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\山の中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\女神\集落全景.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"Hey! Come look! Over here!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―<STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE>, did they find her!?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"No, that's not it, but... what is this...?"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\穴.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―What is this huge hole... It looks just like a grave.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah, there was never anything like this here before, was there?"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―True. There's no way nobody would've noticed something like this until now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Okay, I'm going in."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Is that really safe...?<PG>
"Damn, no good... It's blocked just in there."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―It's big enough for a person to get in easily. 
{PAUSE ""}
Could it be someone was trying to dig somebody's grave?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Who would do something like that..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―Okay, should we try digging?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Yeah. If <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> had been buried somewhere like this..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\穴掘り.ogg" "SE2" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"What are you lot doing?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "500" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\背景\穴.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Ah, <STYLE ID="2">Grand Witch-sama</STYLE>. Actually―"<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"A hole nobody's ever seen before?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">　True, there's never been anything like this here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"So if <STYLE ID="1">Chigaya-chan</STYLE> had been buried here..."
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="2">"But to dig a hole this big without anyone seeing, and bury </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Chigaya</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> in it..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
―True, anyone who tried digging something like this would get spotted partway through for sure...<PG>
<STYLE ID="2">"You lot, that's enough here. I want you searching somewhere else."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Understood."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\詫言編　夢から\砂利を歩く2人.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "800" "0"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\エリカうつむき.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="2">"This can't be... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">The one from the legend, said to lead to Abaddon―"</STYLE>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,人物1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
